- **15-0add-9deg-N2-1600s**: run1 shows 246.6 bar / 0.77 pore fraction (clean membrane); run5 shows 276.8 / 0.85 but has top-gap defect. This is the most promising region.
- **14p5-10deg-N2-1500s**: runs 1-4 show 209–270 bar / 0.65–0.69 — good but lower pore fraction than 15-9deg.
